pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-accent-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: gradient
      gradientType: linear
      angle: 0
      stops:
        - {position: 0, color: "#00D4AA00"}
        - {position: 0.3, color: "$primary"}
        - {position: 0.7, color: "$primary"}
        - {position: 1, color: "#00D4AA00"}
  - elementId: corner-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 50, 4, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 600, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>核心创新点</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 120, 560, 250]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    shadow:
      blur: 12
      color: "#00000040"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: card-num-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 130, 80, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 48
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>01</p>
  - elementId: card-title-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [160, 135, 440, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>$5芯片上的AI智能体</p>
  - elementId: card-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 190, 520, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>完整 ReAct Agent 循环部署在 MCU 级别芯片上，纯C语言实现，无Linux、无Node.js。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">在资源极度受限的嵌入式环境中运行大模型工具调用。</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 120, 560, 250]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    shadow:
      blur: 12
      color: "#00000040"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: card-num-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 130, 80, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 48
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>02</p>
  - elementId: card-title-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [760, 135, 440, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>端侧红外协议编码</p>
  - elementId: card-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 190, 520, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>无需云端码库，红外协议在芯片端直接编码，本地生成主流品牌（美的/格力）控制码。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">支持红外学习，最多存储32组自定义码。</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 400, 560, 250]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    shadow:
      blur: 12
      color: "#00000040"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: card-num-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 410, 80, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 48
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>03</p>
  - elementId: card-title-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [160, 415, 440, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>软件定义硬件</p>
  - elementId: card-body-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 470, 520, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>新增功能只需注册工具，不改核心逻辑。工具注册表机制让硬件扩展像插件一样简单。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">GPIO、红外、灯带、定时任务均可热插拔式扩展。</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-4
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 400, 560, 250]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    shadow:
      blur: 12
      color: "#00000040"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: card-num-4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 410, 80, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 48
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>04</p>
  - elementId: card-title-4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [760, 415, 440, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>零更换成本</p>
  - elementId: card-body-4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 470, 520, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>兼容所有带红外/继电器接口的存量家电，无需更换任何设备，硬件成本仅约100元。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">让传统家电"听懂人话"，而非让用户更换家电。</p>
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 680, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    opacity: 0.3
  - elementId: bottom-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 200, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>MIMICLAW</p>
  - elementId: bottom-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 690, 120, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>09 / 12</p>
